title: frozen_sentinel_core_stasis
tags: 
---
You find a stasis pod. Inside is a human... from your Ark. But he's aged 100 years. He wakes up screaming\: 'Don't let me go back! I've seen the loop!' then turns to dust as the pod opens. #line:frozen_sentinel_core_stasis_00
-> Continue #line:frozen_sentinel_core_stasis_01
